#AI Resume Analyser

## Overview
AI Resume Analyzer is a Flask-based web application that analyzes resumes against job descriptions using ATS-inspired techniques.

## Features
- Resume parsing
- ATS score Calculation
- Job Description Matching
- Skills Extraction
- Resume Section Extraction
- AI-Based Resume Suggestions

## Technologies Used
- Python
- Flask
- HTML
- CSS
- spaCy
- Scikit-learn

## How to Run
```bash
python app.Python
```

